sequenceDiagram
    participant Main as Main Thread
    participant pthread as pthread Library
    participant Thread1 as Worker Thread 1
    participant Thread2 as Worker Thread 2
    
    Main->>pthread: pthread_create(&tid1, NULL, worker, arg1)
    pthread->>Thread1: Create thread
    Thread1->>Thread1: worker(arg1) executes
    
    Main->>pthread: pthread_create(&tid2, NULL, worker, arg2)
    pthread->>Thread2: Create thread
    Thread2->>Thread2: worker(arg2) executes
    
    Note over Main,Thread2: All threads share address space
    
    Main->>pthread: pthread_join(tid1, &retval1)
    Note over Main: Blocks until Thread1 exits
    Thread1->>Thread1: return result1
    Thread1-->>Main: Joined
    
    Main->>pthread: pthread_join(tid2, &retval2)
    Thread2->>Thread2: return result2
    Thread2-->>Main: Joined
    
    Main->>Main: Continue execution
